# Cloudflare reads this file from the build output root, same as _headers.
# Rules are matched top-to-bottom; the first match wins.

# /portfolio has never been a route on this site — the case studies live under
# /projects/. The published resume PDF and the older WordPress-era links both
# point at /portfolio, so those land on a 404 without this. 301 because the
# move is permanent and the old path has no content of its own to preserve.
/portfolio    /projects/  301
/portfolio/*  /projects/  301
